    "title": "inspector-gadget",
    "version": "0.0.1",
    "description": "Config-free codebase dependency viewer. Scans a TypeScript/Node project's source or a .NET project's built assemblies and emits one self-contained, runtime-free codebase-dsm.html with interactive Dependency-Structure-Matrix and Cytoscape graph tabs. Installed as the .NET tool lib.inspector-gadget; the CLI command is inspector-gadget."
